い構図を希望します。https://youtu.be/JW3N-HvU0MA / どちらも夏服でお願いします。制服は何でも構いません、よろしくお願いします。ミコッテの見た目はこちらが参考になります https://twitter.com/_bubtea/status/1543106051033088000?s=21&t=Anb7ZL1eNwZ_crY5gwVTPQ / キャラクターの位置は、動画の女の子と同じ左側です。エルメスであれば右側です。また、向きも似ていてほしいです。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/_bubtea/status/1543106051033088000?s=21&t=Anb7ZL1eNwZ_crY5gwVTPQ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@utino877/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7719c297/uploads/origins/ef1cb8cd-5b2d-41d7-b8de-86b83e098b5d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c57aa07c07681f7b107390f8bff3b5a3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7719c297/uploads/origins/ef1cb8cd-5b2d-41d7-b8de-86b83e098b5d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c57aa07c07681f7b107390f8bff3b5a3, https://si.imgix.net/7719c297/uploads/origins/ef1cb8cd-5b2d-41d7-b8de-86b83e098b5d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa014d54bc94a7afb9d80a0907ae954e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7719c297/uploads/origins/ef1cb8cd-5b2d-41d7-b8de-86b83e098b5d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=617f93d5db9289c9a18a1252b7f55c40 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こにちは初めまして。前回の依頼をキャンセルして申し訳ありません、私の参考資料が間違っていたことに気づいたからです。\n\n可能であれば、私のFF14のOCのアートをこのようにお願いしたいです: https://twitter.com/utino877/status/1544746839018438656\n\nOC: https://imgur.com/a/CstOGf9\n\n片方の手で彼の腰を抱き、もう片方の手で彼のシャツを押し上げて胸を露出させたいと思います。顔を赤らめて、恥ずかしそうに、困っているような表情をしてほしいです。構図、ポーズ、背景は自由です。目の下のビューティーマーク、長い下まつげ、そして日焼けした肌にご注目ください。\n\nこの度はご検討いただきありがとうございました。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@utino877/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/99ff71ca/uploads/origins/fb0e7000-b4b4-45ff-8881-1ba6a92768b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93aff0af8edafcbe1b5797e62e335771", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/99ff71ca/uploads/origins/fb0e7000-b4b4-45ff-8881-1ba6a92768b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93aff0af8edafcbe1b5797e62e335771, https://si.imgix.net/99ff71ca/uploads/origins/fb0e7000-b4b4-45ff-8881-1ba6a92768b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b703810dcb96d6c1dbab15f49b5f14b1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/99ff71ca/uploads/origins/fb0e7000-b4b4-45ff-8881-1ba6a92768b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd8c9582620bcd2edaeef27f9cb459b0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I was looking on Twitter and saw the art that you did of Hermes from FFXIV and loved it,  so I wanted to send a request to you! \n\nCould you draw my FFXIV character? He likes to be alone but cares for other people but he isn't the best at expressing himself to others so he keeps to himself. His facial expression would be calm with a bit of sadness mixed in.  He often likes to hang out in places that are quiet and aren't too bright. I will leave the pose up to you. \n\nThank you for considering my request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1t4wrQfZB3-0XYdpfx97ADymwQaBoIXCD?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@utino877/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/61f528b2/uploads/origins/8e45da87-8776-4783-9046-84a53c2966e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58b726e5640d38cab0572412382bfaa4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/61f528b2/uploads/origins/8e45da87-8776-4783-9046-84a53c2966e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58b726e5640d38cab0572412382bfaa4, https://si.imgix.net/61f528b2/uploads/origins/8e45da87-8776-4783-9046-84a53c2966e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e41e46bf2e7a1640e1d066cd5684e248 2x, https://si.imgix.net/61f528b2/uploads/origins/8e45da87-8776-4783-9046-84a53c2966e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=20